# Cloudberry does not use gen_node_support.pl: the NodeTag enum is maintained by
# hand in nodes.h, copyfuncs.funcs.c / copyfuncs.switch.c are committed to the
# repository and #included by copyfuncs.c, and outfuncs/readfuncs/equalfuncs are
# plain hand-written sources. src/backend/nodes/Makefile likewise never invokes
# the generator, so there is nothing to generate here.
